00:22:45.626 --> 00:22:49.456
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:51.766 --> 00:22:54.926
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.136 --> 00:22:57.566
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:58.666 --> 00:23:02.466
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:03.506 --> 00:23:10.136
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:10.876 --> 00:23:16.146
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:16.516 --> 00:23:23.326
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:23.826 --> 00:23:29.266
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:45.716 --> 00:23:47.846
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.116 --> 00:23:51.816
We revived the Rune-Gods
and finally defeated Zagato...

00:23:51.926 --> 00:23:54.286
...the one who abducted
Princess Emeraude!

00:23:54.386 --> 00:23:58.186
Now Cephiro will be saved,
and we can go back to Tokyo!

00:23:58.296 --> 00:24:00.766
However,
our happiness was fleeting...

00:24:00.866 --> 00:24:03.356
...as something
unbelievable happened.

00:24:03.466 --> 00:24:05.396
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:05.506 --> 00:24:08.796
The Unbelievable Truth
About the Legendary Magic Knights!

00:24:08.906 --> 00:24:09.106
The Unbelievable Truth
About the Legendary Magic Knights

00:24:09.106 --> 00:24:11.076
The Unbelievable Truth
About the Legendary Magic Knights
You have to watch it!

00:24:11.076 --> 00:24:12.906
The Unbelievable Truth
About the Legendary Magic Knights

00:24:12.906 --> 00:24:19.836
Who is it today?

00:24:20.816 --> 00:24:22.806
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:22.916 --> 00:24:28.876
Look forward to the next episode!
